	('cf340f89-ed68-40f5-bc3d-689a5a042b50', 'cca7fb21-743c-4ba8-beaa-be07ae92ef07', '35f09360-f43f-41e0-903e-2b297f25430d', 'Original Passport/ Identity Card/ Thai Driving License/ Foreign or International License (Not Expired)', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:02:35.296449+00', '2025-09-15 16:02:35.296449+00'),
	('939b5348-4c01-4e95-bfc5-101ca08fa4f7', 'cca7fb21-743c-4ba8-beaa-be07ae92ef07', '7998a568-a1e9-4a5c-a2f1-44cb68f45ec6', 'On the start date of motorbikes rental, Renter must make full payment of rental and deposit, price will be agreed upon between Renter and Mr. Scooter. Deposit starts from 2000 baht depending on the motorbike type you require.', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:02:36.419021+00', '2025-09-15 16:02:36.419021+00'),
	('359a1a60-e6ca-45a9-9225-b7097c9d71b9', 'cca7fb21-743c-4ba8-beaa-be07ae92ef07', '107d5b20-a6ef-482d-95bc-7febd2ed679c', 'Renter must notify Mr. Scooter the intention to extend rental period prior to the expiry of rental period for extension of rental period, refrain from notifying means infringement of Renter and Mr. Scooter.', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:02:37.395542+00', '2025-09-15 16:02:37.395542+00'),
	('98afc6e9-aed9-4a10-81ac-a0a0397ddde6', 'cca7fb21-743c-4ba8-beaa-be07ae92ef07', '2eda405c-300e-4f3d-b28d-fd1ab8946183', 'Mr. Scooter will not be responsible in case of flat tyre or all other damages except in case of engine is broken down which is not incurred by any causes. Mr. Scooter will be responsible and/or replace with other motorbike appropriately.', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:02:38.486665+00', '2025-09-15 16:02:38.486665+00'),
	('ce0165db-aec0-4ff2-8b14-5a5c6db7a0c5', 'cca7fb21-743c-4ba8-beaa-be07ae92ef07', '5d16e71f-170d-487f-86e3-0527a76f05ab', 'Renter must collect and return motorbike at office of Mr. Scooter only, there is no outdoor service to collect and send scooter outside the place.', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:02:39.810734+00', '2025-09-15 16:02:39.810734+00'),
	('2954c00a-cae4-465f-8c6c-f8f4c6c1df79', 'cca7fb21-743c-4ba8-beaa-be07ae92ef07', '9a3e6ed8-89ca-4942-b7d5-d2b05bc30329', 'Renter must be careful in parking of motorbike. It should be parked at court with security system and properly locked the motorbike. In case of robbery, Renter must be responsible at price according to age or condition of motorbike or upon agreement between Mr. Scooter and Renter.', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:02:40.904653+00', '2025-09-15 16:02:40.904653+00'),
	('dc29764f-581b-4c3d-bc70-0f203ca0d252', '78633b0b-daa1-4a54-abac-d000364ca131', '44c3c2df-4025-4455-843f-f12d6a56dc97', 'Must have a valid passport and driving license of which we will keep a copy', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:03:09.423388+00', '2025-09-15 16:03:09.423388+00'),
	('9f99f547-7e4e-48bb-be3a-ac1281cedbb5', '78633b0b-daa1-4a54-abac-d000364ca131', '1d94b86b-c09c-46c6-ada1-24f9a0e775a8', 'Deposit for all rentals is to be paid before receiving the bike and will be returned accordingly after inspection of the bikes returned condition. Note: Failure to return the bike to the shop at the end of your rental or failure to properly schedule a pickup with us will result in a loss of deposit.', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:03:10.529031+00', '2025-09-15 16:03:10.529031+00'),
	('c88a6e6e-a0e0-4d23-9abe-463751cda320', '78633b0b-daa1-4a54-abac-d000364ca131', 'f7dfabb8-30e9-4738-8c04-ea1d9b5123d1', 'Payments can be made on a weekly, monthly, or yearly basis. Simply deposit the money into our account bank from cash deposit machine and send us a notification/pic of the receipt or made cash payment at NK Guesthouse 2 (Reception Counter).', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:03:11.468824+00', '2025-09-15 16:03:11.468824+00'),
	('f4a66b6f-4065-4e0b-9f02-879e59ce3f0d', '78633b0b-daa1-4a54-abac-d000364ca131', '00fa3cab-2776-40ae-a07c-5e8134c5a40c', 'All customers are allowed to extend their rentals as long as they would like, or return as needed. (Within working hours) For that reason availability is not known in advance so we currently do not offer reservations or bookings early. We recommend contacting us upon arrival or a day before so we can give you an updated list of available bikes.', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:03:12.750569+00', '2025-09-15 16:03:12.750569+00'),
	('c237605d-b02d-4b7d-88eb-f2e05f71bba0', '78633b0b-daa1-4a54-abac-d000364ca131', '85252d17-e0d7-4f67-ad05-3faa8e32d271', 'Driving license in Thailand are required by law, though rarely checked and generally any ID or passport will suffice. However the actual law is a bit of a confused issue with even Thai police officers rarely knowing the correct law. Most countries license which includes an English translation on it, or an International Drivers Permit are approved by Thailand for use while on a Tourist visa. If staying for over 6 months or on a non-tourist visa a Thai license is required.', NULL, '2025-09-15 16:03:13.705802+00', '2025-09-15 16:03:13.705802+00'),
